# REVIEWED: 5cdd54c955acb619
#: ../../d_query.rst:3
msgid "Query d-portal"
msgstr "Consulta en d-portal"

# REVIEWED: 51488ceab53a5b9b
#: ../../d_query.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Dquery <https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/dquery/>`_ provides a read only "
"SQL interface to the d-portal database. This includes non-standard "
"attributes and extensions to the IATI Standard which are not displayed by "
"the d-portal site. Data can be downloaded from Dquery in XML, JSON, HTML, "
"and CSV formats."
msgstr ""
"`Dquery <https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/dquery/>`_ proporciona una "
"interfaz SQL de solo lectura para la base de datos de d-portal. Esto incluye"
" atributos no estándar y extensiones a la Norma IATI que no se muestran en "
"el sitio de d-portal. Los datos pueden descargarse desde Dquery en formatos "
"XML, JSON, HTML y CSV."

# REVIEWED: 59cb192df2e3f34d
#: ../../d_query.rst:8
msgid ""
"Dquery includes example queries, and the option to view the results of "
"queries on the d-portal site."
msgstr ""
"Dquery incluye consultas de ejemplo y ofrece la opción de ver los resultados"
" de las consultas en el sitio d-portal."

# REVIEWED: 7540f8c4bb2d51f9
#: ../../d_query.rst:10
msgid ""
"In depth documentation for Dquery is available on `Github "
"<https://github.com/notshi/dquery/blob/master/readme.md>`_."
msgstr ""
"En `Github <https://github.com/notshi/dquery/blob/master/readme.md>`_ hay "
"documentación detallada sobre Dquery."
